# 🌾 MGNREGA Karnataka Analytics Dashboard

### 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes and visualizes **district-level performance data** of the **Mahatma Gandhi National Rural Employment Guarantee Act (MGNREGA)** for **Karnataka (FY 2023–24)**.  
It helps understand how rural employment, expenditure, and household participation vary across districts.

---

### 🎯 Objectives
- Clean and process MGNREGA dataset from Government of India’s open data portal.  
- Compute key performance indicators (KPIs) for all Karnataka districts.  
- Visualize metrics like **Total Expenditure, Wages, Active Workers, and Average Wage Rate**.  
- Build an **interactive analytics dashboard** using Python and Dash.  

---

### 🧩 Tech Stack
| Tool / Library | Purpose |
|----------------|----------|
| **Python** | Core data processing |
| **Pandas** | Data cleaning and transformation |
| **Plotly / Dash** | Interactive visualization dashboard |
| **Matplotlib / Seaborn** | Charts for static visuals |
| **Power BI (optional)** | For comparative dashboard demo |
| **Jupyter Notebook** | Data exploration and KPIs generation |

